---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "@utils/site";
const updated = "2026-05-06";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Pocketey handles cookies, analytics, and advertising data. We use a cookieless analytics tool and disclose every third-party script we run."
  pageType="static"
>
  <article class="prose-page mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-amber-400 text-stroke-ink">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm opacity-60">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed">
      This page explains what data {SITE.name} collects when you visit the
      site or play one of the games, what we use it for, and what choices you
      have. Plain English first, formal language second.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-extrabold">Who we are</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      {SITE.name} is a small, independently operated game site reachable at
      {SITE.url}. It is run by a solo developer rather than a company, and is
      hosted on Cloudflare Pages.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-extrabold">What we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      The site itself uses Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is a cookieless
      analytics product. It records aggregate page views, country-level
      geography, the referring site, and basic information about your browser
      such as the user agent string. It does not assign you a persistent
      identifier, does not build a behavior profile, and does not share your
      data with third-party advertising networks. We do not run any other
      first-party analytics tool by default.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      Each individual game stores a small amount of progress data inside your
      browser using <code>localStorage</code>. This typically includes high
      scores, the level you reached, your sound preference, and similar
      gameplay state. None of this leaves your device. You can clear it at any
      time by clearing site data for {SITE.url} in your browser settings.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-extrabold">Advertising</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      Some pages display advertising provided by Google AdSense and game-focused
      ad networks such as CrazyGames SDK, GameMonetize and AdinPlay. These
      partners are independent companies and may set their own cookies, web
      beacons, or device identifiers in order to serve, measure, and report on
      ads. They may also use that information to personalize ads on other sites
      you visit.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      You can review and adjust the choices Google makes about your ads at
      <a class="underline" href="https://adssettings.google.com/">adssettings.google.com</a>.
      You can opt out of personalized advertising from many third-party
      networks at the
      <a class="underline" href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org/">Network Advertising Initiative</a>
      and the
      <a class="underline" href="https://optout.aboutads.info/">Digital Advertising Alliance</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-extrabold">Children</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      The site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect
      personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided
      personal information to us, please reach out via the contact page and we
      will delete it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-extrabold">International transfers</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      Because the site is delivered through Cloudflare's global content delivery
      network, requests are routed to the data center closest to the visitor.
      Cloudflare and Google operate infrastructure across many countries; their
      respective privacy policies cover how they handle traffic data in transit.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-extrabold">Your choices</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      You can disable JavaScript or use an ad blocker to opt out of advertising
      on the site. You can clear local game progress at any time via your
      browser. You can request information about data we hold by emailing the
      address on the contact page; because we operate at a small scale, we
      typically have very little data attached to any one visitor.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-extrabold">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      When we change anything material on this page, we will update the date at
      the top of the document and, where the change affects how data is
      collected, post a short notice on the home page. Continued use of the
      site after such a change means you accept the updated policy.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-extrabold">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      Questions about this policy can be sent through the
      <a class="underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>. We try to respond
      within a few business days.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
